我也绝不会在定义题里问‘什么是西罗定理？’。不过试卷里肯定会有一道题需要你熟知西罗定理的陈述。是的，除非在最后大题部分，比如我们要求‘证明任一有限整环必为域’，
'What is the Sylow theorem?', okay? But there will definitely be a problem where you'll have to know the statement of the Sylow theorem, yeah. Except in the case where at the... at the last section, where we'd say, you know, 'Prove that a finite integral domain is a field,

33
